cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "wet" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'wet: Stream Flow and Water Temperature for the BC Freshwater Atlas'
version: 0.4.14
abstract: 'Mean monthly and annual stream flow for the British Columbia Freshwater
  Atlas (FWA), published openly per stream segment from two sources: the Pacific Climate
  Impacts Consortium''s (PCIC) routed hydrologic model, and an open water balance
  fitted at Water Survey of Canada (HYDAT) gauges. Daily flow and water temperature
  at hydrometric stations are summarised per year over month-day windows, so each
  year can be compared with normal. Under active development.'
